# Deep-research domain handoff (project-specific)

Use with evolve cycles and domain-mining work. Cite
[Corpus: decisions] `docs/decisions/ev-097-deep-research-domain-handoff.md`.
Do **not** put EV-/Corpus ids in operator UI or OpenAPI copy.

## When this applies

- Evolve needs evidence not already in lean `docs/domain/` canonicals / `rules/`
- Operator asks for deep research / domain mining handoff
- National/exchange profile or quality-bar work depends on external sources

## Do

1. AskQuestion whether to invoke skill `deep-research-domain-handoff`
2. Run **gate A** (scope) before emitting the filled `handoff-prompt-template.md`
3. After research returns: **gate B** (findings review)
4. Before editing canonicals / `rules/`: **gate C** (promote) then
   `mine-domain-sources` for publish + defer-to-latest
5. Without gate C: only session notes and/or `docs/domain/mining/<slug>-mining-notes.md`

## Do not

- Silently edit `TAC_VALIDATION.md`, `IWXXM_CONVERSION.md`, `IWXXM_VALIDATION.md`, or SoT `rules/` rows
- Dump copyrighted full-text into git
- Invent a second domain tree outside the lean hub layout
- Rewrite pack `orchestrators/evolve` for this — project skill + this rule are enough

